                    {
                        "description": "Cmd+Shift+S → screenshot selection to clipboard (screencapture -i -c). Shell command runs directly — no macOS shortcut settings needed, works in all apps including Ghostty. Two manipulators: left_command+shift in excluded apps (no swap), left_control+shift elsewhere (swap fires on modifier keydown).",
