                    {
                        "description": "Cmd+Space → toggle input method (English ↔ Chinese Pinyin). Uses Karabiner variable 'input_chinese' to track state — no macOS shortcut settings needed. Both sides use language regex ('^en' / '^zh') to avoid hardcoding input source IDs. Variable can go out of sync if switched via menu bar; press twice to re-sync. Four manipulators: 2 app contexts × 2 toggle states.",
                        "manipulators": [
